 in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori) Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:58\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"0\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Bali, Indonesia $50/night (Photo_Hotel_Room)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:61\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"444\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:63\" name=\"Categories: Flights (Icon_Flight) · Hotels (Icon_Hotel) · Trains (Icon_Train) · Ferry (Icon_Ferry) · Bus (Icon_Bus) Tabs: Home · Orders · Deals · Account\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:64\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"888\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"“Let’s Travel you in.” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” Fields: Email or Phone Number · Password “Forgot password?” · Sign In · “or sign in with” “Don’t have an account?” · Sign Up\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:67\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2081\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:69\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:72\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #007A8C + #336749 and Inter • Media: logo, photos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:73\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, pressed, focused / filled fields, disabled • Headers, language selector, tab bar, flight ticket, category items, journey and hotel cards, social sign-in buttons • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:76\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2421\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:77\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"5:79\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, empty fields, pressed / disabled where shown)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"2e06820a-0d97-4eb5-b512-fcbcb46d72a8"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_20f23b1a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
